{"id":"leyenda","lemma":"leyenda","pos":"noun","rank":2054,"glosses":["legend, saga, traditional story","life of a saint","legend, idol (famous and admired person)"],"ipa":"/leˈʝenda/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"leyendas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-leyenda.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él es una verdadera leyenda.","en":"He's a true legend.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"true, real","l":"verdadero"},null]},{"text":"Según la leyenda esta casa está embrujada.","en":"Legend has it that this house is haunted.","words":[{"g":"according to"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"house"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"bewitched, haunted","l":"embrujado"}]},{"text":"Tom es una leyenda.","en":"Tom is a legend.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/101978","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Cuenta la leyenda que él fue abandonado en el bosque.","en":"The legend says he was abandoned in the woods.","words":[{"g":"count, tally"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"abandoned"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"forest"}]},{"text":"El consumo de drogas recreativas inspira muchas leyendas urbanas.","en":"Recreational drug use inspires many urban legends.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"consumption"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"drug","l":"droga"},null,{"g":"to inspire","l":"inspirar"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},null,{"g":"urban","l":"urbano"}]}]}